  triage:title "W.3 sqlite degradation still sink-dependent: emit before mark_sqlite_unavailable" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/sqlite_observability.rs emits the degradation event before marking runtime status. If the emit sink fails, the sqlite degradation state is never recorded in runtime status — the failure is silently hidden." ;
